          "description": "A Kids Podcast all about bringing BIG fun and BIG JOY for little ears. \n\nThe kind of kids audio parents love listening along to as well, The Great Cool Kids Podcast takes you on engaging and imaginative adventures that are full of heart. Your brand-new-go-to audio for kids aged 2-7 years, consider it a new tool in your parenting toolkit. Each week, join host Jess Villanueva (toddler mum + pro party-starter) for a magical mix of original stories, imagination, dance parties, encouragement, and fun-filled journeys that are full of heartwarming values like friendship, working together, making friends, bravery, and conquering your fears. We'll visit places your kids already know and love like the library, the beach and the grocery store, and also travel to out of this world places like Outer Space, and Under the Sea!\nNew episodes drop every Wednesday! See you then, Great Cool Families!\n\nThis podcast contains ads. Yoto does not control these ads and they do not represent us or our opinions. Please listen with care.",
